  "ruleText": "Liq 1104.05 Illegal Delivery. The commission shall investigate and prosecute both the individual and the company involved in any delivery violating the provisions of RSA 179:1 or RSA 179:5, I.\n\nSource. #6837, Interim, eff 9-1-98, EXPIRED: 12-30-98\n\nNew. #6924, eff 1-1-99, EXPIRED: 1-1-07\n\nNew. #9441-A, eff 6-9-11; ss by #12968, eff 1-3-20 (formerly Liq 1104.06)",
